  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Marketing"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Marketing Minor develops the quantitative and qualitative skills and knowledge expected of marketing professionals. Students receive grounding in marketing theories and principles, in marketing metrics and financial marketing, as well as in the IT tools necessary to develop and implement marketing strategies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The number of elective courses has been expanded to allow students to focus their Minor on a particular area within Marketing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Ted Rogers School of Business Management, Marketing Management Department"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Business Management - Marketing Management Major (regular and co-operative options)",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Business Management - Marketing Management Major",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/trsm/business_mgt/marketing_management_major/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Required courses (2):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MKT 100 Principles of Marketing or HTM 302 Marketing Principles",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MKT 100",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/marketing/MKT/100/"
        },
        {
          "text": "HTM 302",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTM/302/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MKT 300 Marketing Metrics and Analysis",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MKT 300",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/marketing/MKT/300/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus four (4) of the following:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MKT 400 Understanding Consumers or RMG 302 Retail Consumer Insight",
      "links": [
