      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Generalist: This theme provides students with an overview of marketing strategy. Students who wish to pursue this theme will be recommended to select four courses from the following group: MKT 400 , MKT 500 / HTR 741 / RMG 700 , MKT 510 , MKT 535 , MKT 600 , MKT 700 .",
